# On top of karotz-6.1-debug.config and karotz-6.1-realnand.config, for the
# hub A/B on Gengar by kexec (REVIEW-6.1.md 1.1, 2026-11-24): the built-in
# command line without usbcore.old_scheme_first, so it is the default again
# (0) and the device descriptor is read in its own 18-byte buffer, the
# read that failed one boot in two on the SLOB kernel. With CONFIG_SLUB
# (karotz-6.1.config) the hub must enumerate every boot. The power patch
# stays in both kernels. Not for the flash.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttySAC0,115200"
